WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.039
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.130 --> 01:42.940
[Episode 2]

01:48.300 --> 01:50.830
What's going on? The test hasn't started yet?

01:52.700 --> 01:54.500
Lu Li hasn't yet come?

01:55.289 --> 01:57.390
[Wu Yang Duke's disciple, Xue]

01:58.530 --> 01:59.580
Look over there.

01:59.580 --> 02:01.100
It's about to start.

02:10.460 --> 02:12.460
All disciples, listen to the order.

02:12.780 --> 02:14.610
Demons have infiltrated the boundary.

02:14.610 --> 02:15.300
Demons?

02:15.300 --> 02:16.460
It's among you.

02:17.450 --> 02:18.710
Within half of an hour,

02:18.780 --> 02:20.540
whoever finds and defeats them

02:21.180 --> 02:23.310
will be deemed to have passed the test.

02:23.740 --> 02:24.870
The test begins now.

02:31.140 --> 02:32.140
What's this?

02:32.220 --> 02:33.579
What's this guy doing?

03:15.500 --> 03:16.360
That's enough.

03:16.579 --> 03:18.510
The test requires only to beat him.

03:25.730 --> 03:26.350
You…

03:26.660 --> 03:28.220
These demons are vicious.

03:28.820 --> 03:30.060
If you do good to him,

03:30.420 --> 03:32.079
you're harming your fellows.

03:36.620 --> 03:37.780
The demon has been removed.

03:37.780 --> 03:38.900
I'm one of the disciples, Xi.

03:38.900 --> 03:40.630
Can I advance to the next level?

03:42.660 --> 03:44.520
Why is the incense still burning?

03:44.650 --> 03:46.450
Is there another demon among us?

03:48.180 --> 03:48.700
Could there be another one? ,

03:48.700 --> 03:49.660
It's not over yet.

03:49.660 --> 03:50.660
Are you the demon?

03:50.660 --> 03:51.460
Are you the demon?

03:51.460 --> 03:52.300
Stay away from me.

03:52.300 --> 03:53.300
Stay away from me.

03:56.620 --> 03:58.020
What a trick!

03:58.660 --> 03:59.590
The demon is her.

04:01.020 --> 04:01.450
Me?

04:03.220 --> 04:04.140
If not,

04:04.410 --> 04:06.740
why did the demon have to attack you?

04:07.060 --> 04:08.660
And why did you plead for him?

04:09.820 --> 04:10.750
That's slander.

04:11.860 --> 04:12.660
Cut it out.

04:19.180 --> 04:20.579
I learned such a trick as sprinkling powder

04:20.579 --> 04:22.100
when I was six years old.

04:34.140 --> 04:34.900
Lu Li?

04:35.420 --> 04:36.740
How did you get in?

04:38.100 --> 04:40.100
I have legs, of course I walked in.

04:41.370 --> 04:43.420
I think you were taken as a test question.

04:43.420 --> 04:44.260
So

04:45.260 --> 04:46.860
I didn't come empty-handed.

04:51.659 --> 04:52.700
Here's your chance.

04:52.700 --> 04:53.560
Go and kill him.

04:54.980 --> 04:56.620
No, I'm scared.

04:57.820 --> 04:59.620
You'd better find someone else.

04:59.650 --> 05:00.420
You can't?

05:00.580 --> 05:01.040
I can't.

05:01.940 --> 05:03.470
What are you talking about?

05:03.700 --> 05:04.360
I'm afraid.

05:05.020 --> 05:07.220
You just did a good job. Why can't you do it now?

05:07.220 --> 05:08.260
Hey, look at this.

05:10.860 --> 05:11.460
Oh, I see.

05:11.900 --> 05:14.170
You have the guts to fight with girls.

05:16.460 --> 05:17.180
What you did

05:17.340 --> 05:18.300
just now with the move

05:18.300 --> 05:19.210
is not bad.

05:22.940 --> 05:23.460
Try it.

05:25.340 --> 05:26.940
You're underestimating me.

05:37.860 --> 05:38.420
Wow!

05:43.340 --> 05:45.070
So it's a demon of a tree branch.

05:45.180 --> 05:45.900
Wow!

05:48.020 --> 05:48.980
Awesome.

05:49.860 --> 05:50.980
That's something.

05:51.180 --> 05:53.860
I accidentally swung and he died?

05:55.940 --> 05:57.650
In fact, what Wu Yang Duke plans to test

05:57.650 --> 05:59.060
is the strong courage to overcome fear

05:59.060 --> 06:00.860
as well as demons.

06:01.580 --> 06:03.060
If you don't have it,

06:03.130 --> 06:04.580
no matter how great you are,

06:04.580 --> 06:06.260
you're not what they want.

06:06.420 --> 06:07.180
Got it?

06:11.980 --> 06:14.110
Welcome to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

06:15.020 --> 06:15.580
This is

06:15.700 --> 06:17.420
the senior female disciple of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

06:17.420 --> 06:18.020
Bai Feng.

06:17.660 --> 06:19.250
[Chief female disciple of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke, Bai Feng]

06:19.460 --> 06:20.820
We've seen

06:20.820 --> 06:22.350
your performance just now.

06:22.380 --> 06:24.940
Later on, all the disciples who pass this round of tests

06:24.940 --> 06:26.800
will receive a golden flower card

06:27.220 --> 06:29.750
and will be qualified to enter the next round.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.780
I've made it to the second round.

06:43.780 --> 06:45.580
I've made it to the second round.

06:45.860 --> 06:46.409
My hand!

06:46.409 --> 06:47.250
My hand.

06:47.820 --> 06:48.300
Brother.

06:48.300 --> 06:50.100
I just saw you fly over in a flash.

06:50.610 --> 06:51.900
Teach me sometime.

06:52.420 --> 06:54.540
100 taels for a pinch. 300 taels for pain.

06:54.540 --> 06:56.340
Brother, I'm Wang Jian. And you?

06:56.940 --> 06:57.700
I'm Lu Li.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.030
Nice to meet you.

07:06.460 --> 07:08.020
Disciples without the golden flower cards

07:08.020 --> 07:09.420
shouldn't be discouraged either.

07:09.420 --> 07:11.020
The Mansion of Wu Yang Duke always welcomes

07:11.020 --> 07:13.580
those who want to fight evil and defend justice.

07:13.580 --> 07:15.840
But only if you have the strength to do so,

07:16.580 --> 07:17.980
not by luck.

07:18.980 --> 07:21.060
Those who pass with the help of others…

07:21.060 --> 07:22.060
It's him.

07:22.380 --> 07:23.110
won't count.

07:26.330 --> 07:27.140
Liu Shao

07:27.620 --> 07:28.150
cheated.

07:36.940 --> 07:39.460
This is the senior male disciple of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

07:39.460 --> 07:40.260
Du Mingchong.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.820
In the past, he was the one

07:42.900 --> 07:45.360
who decided the selection of the disciples.

07:46.460 --> 07:47.770
Senior Du,

07:47.900 --> 07:49.500
do you have other plans here?

07:50.020 --> 07:51.060
Did she get through

07:51.060 --> 07:52.980
with your help?

08:00.180 --> 08:00.780
Senior Du,

08:01.260 --> 08:02.060
I just gave her

08:02.460 --> 08:03.820
some advice.

08:04.540 --> 08:06.140
She managed to do it herself.

08:07.860 --> 08:08.860
You don't deserve

08:09.140 --> 08:10.780
to call me “senior”.

08:17.060 --> 08:20.140
I thought we were peers now that I'm in the Duke's Mansion.

08:20.140 --> 08:22.460
But there's a hierarchy in the Duke's Mansion,

08:22.460 --> 08:24.060
unlike what Wu Yang Duke said

08:24.060 --> 08:25.390
that everyone is equal.

08:26.340 --> 08:27.980
Forgive me for crossing the line.

08:27.980 --> 08:29.500
You're beating around the bush

08:29.500 --> 08:31.830
and pressuring me with what the Lord said.

08:32.220 --> 08:34.580
Then let me see what you can do.

08:37.020 --> 08:37.620
Ouch

08:41.900 --> 08:42.500
Senior Du.

08:43.100 --> 08:44.740
You're the eldest disciple of the mansion.

08:44.740 --> 08:46.740
Why bother with a newcomer like him?

08:47.420 --> 08:50.100
-Besides, the selection process is strict. -Don't move.

08:50.100 --> 08:51.300
-If she doesn't have the talent... -He didn't touch you, did he?

08:51.300 --> 08:53.230
how can she get into the next round?

08:54.820 --> 08:55.980
My ass.

08:57.020 --> 08:59.140
I've already sent out the golden flower card.

08:59.140 --> 09:00.140
Senior Du.

09:00.300 --> 09:01.500
Will you do me a favor?

09:02.570 --> 09:04.220
Since Bai Feng has asked,

09:04.420 --> 09:07.020
-I should do her the favor. -Lu Li, are you okay?

09:07.180 --> 09:09.440
As for whether you can stay in the future,

09:09.580 --> 09:11.180
it depends on their ability.

09:16.140 --> 09:16.900
Liu Shao.

09:19.140 --> 09:19.780
Thank you.

09:20.620 --> 09:22.420
All the disciples who have received their golden flower cards,

09:22.420 --> 09:24.080
please follow me to Yu Yu Hall.

09:34.860 --> 09:35.390
Brother.

09:36.900 --> 09:37.430
Brother.

09:37.450 --> 09:38.140
What's up?

09:38.500 --> 09:39.780
Do you like Liu Shao?

09:41.380 --> 09:42.940
What are you talking about? Unless I'm blind.

09:42.940 --> 09:44.900
Why does helping her have to mean I like her?

09:44.900 --> 09:45.620
Maybe

09:45.850 --> 09:47.580
she bought me into helping her.

09:48.180 --> 09:49.020
As the old saying goes,

09:49.020 --> 09:51.140
beating is kissing, scolding is loving.

09:51.140 --> 09:53.400
Beating is kissing, scolding is loving?

09:54.300 --> 09:55.300
I'm just kidding.

09:55.500 --> 09:56.740
Look, there's the Yu Yu Hall in front of us.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.940
Let me take you there.

09:58.250 --> 09:59.020
Go.

09:59.060 --> 09:59.590
Let's go.

10:01.300 --> 10:04.700
[Yu Yu Hall]

10:15.180 --> 10:15.580
Kneel.

10:25.100 --> 10:27.300
I've arranged for you to catch Liu Shao.

10:27.980 --> 10:30.020
But only two of you came back alive.

10:30.260 --> 10:32.140
And you came back empty-handed.

10:32.380 --> 10:33.100
How dare you

10:33.380 --> 10:35.140
show up in front of me?

10:36.460 --> 10:37.740
I managed to do it.

10:38.060 --> 10:40.060
It's Lu Sheng's disciple

10:40.140 --> 10:41.090
who ruined it.

10:41.090 --> 10:42.260
Yes, it's Lu Li.

10:42.420 --> 10:44.350
Lu Li was protecting her in secret.

10:53.140 --> 10:54.670
Ao Hen sent you here, right?

10:55.020 --> 10:56.650
Go back and tell that old demon.

10:56.650 --> 10:58.110
I'll take care of Liu Shao.

10:58.330 --> 10:59.390
Tell her to give up.

11:02.780 --> 11:03.940
For so many years,

11:04.780 --> 11:07.540
I've been searching for demon energy

11:07.570 --> 11:09.170
to nourish your young master

11:09.460 --> 11:11.540
and barely keep him alive.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.300
Now

11:13.700 --> 11:15.900
it's a rare chance that Liu Shao shows up

11:16.180 --> 11:18.180
and my son can be cured.

11:18.860 --> 11:21.220
But you two let her get away.

11:22.460 --> 11:24.660
It can't be pardoned.

11:28.060 --> 11:28.980
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

11:28.980 --> 11:29.940
Forgive me.

11:30.060 --> 11:31.520
Forgive me, Your Majesty!

11:31.580 --> 11:33.820
-In the way of my son's survival. - Forgive me, Your Majesty!

11:33.820 --> 11:35.620
You losers.

11:36.340 --> 11:38.050
How dare you beg for mercy?

12:16.620 --> 12:17.660
Yin, be a good boy.

12:19.540 --> 12:20.460
I promise you.

12:21.970 --> 12:23.940
I will get Liu Shao

12:24.420 --> 12:27.420
and transfer the power from her body to you.

12:49.260 --> 12:50.660
This is Wu Yang Duke.

12:51.100 --> 12:52.630
The lord of the human world?

12:53.660 --> 12:55.260
What an overrated eye candy!

12:55.740 --> 12:57.020
He's useless

12:57.060 --> 12:58.520
except for his good looks.

12:59.340 --> 13:01.220
Can't you see the seat of Wu Yang Duke

13:01.220 --> 13:02.140
is still empty?

13:06.930 --> 13:07.500
I mean…

13:07.660 --> 13:09.500
I mean, how stupid are you?

13:11.580 --> 13:13.820
That's Wu Yang Duke's top general,

13:14.060 --> 13:15.320
Fang Zhan, Chief Fang.

13:17.210 --> 13:17.810
Forget it.

13:18.860 --> 13:19.860
You'll get to know

13:20.060 --> 13:21.060
in the mansion.

13:23.980 --> 13:24.940
Actually,

13:25.210 --> 13:28.270
there's nothing wrong with being overrated eye candy.

13:28.570 --> 13:29.860
Overrated as they are,

13:31.090 --> 13:32.820
they're good-looking anyway.

13:33.940 --> 13:35.700
They look much more pleasing to the eye

13:35.700 --> 13:37.830
than those with an intimidating face.

13:38.260 --> 13:38.820
Happy?

13:38.820 --> 13:40.260
Who is overrated? Who are you talking about?

13:40.260 --> 13:40.970
Be quiet.

13:42.540 --> 13:43.260
Today,

13:44.130 --> 13:45.700
you've come to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

13:45.700 --> 13:48.100
Although you haven't yet become official disciples,

13:48.100 --> 13:49.260
you should know

13:49.500 --> 13:50.980
every disciple of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

13:50.980 --> 13:53.740
has the responsibility of protecting the human race.

13:53.740 --> 13:55.140
All of you have come here.

13:55.300 --> 13:57.060
I'm sure you all have the desire to eradicate evil

13:57.060 --> 13:58.500
and protect the people.

13:59.180 --> 14:00.380
But to do that,

14:00.930 --> 14:03.100
you will inevitably face risks at all times,

14:03.100 --> 14:04.460
in danger of dying.

14:06.340 --> 14:07.470
If you feel remorse,

14:07.980 --> 14:09.180
you can leave now.

14:13.860 --> 14:15.660
I'll be able to learn something,

14:15.820 --> 14:18.080
so that I don't have to be afraid of Ao Hen.

14:21.620 --> 14:22.370
Good.

14:23.580 --> 14:24.640
If that's the case,

14:25.060 --> 14:27.140
you can settle down in the mansion first.

14:27.140 --> 14:28.820
I'll wait for you to go through hard study

14:28.820 --> 14:29.860
and rigorous trials

14:29.860 --> 14:30.920
to finally succeed

14:31.300 --> 14:33.830
and pacify the demons and protect the beings.

14:35.140 --> 14:37.470
Pacify the demons and protect the beings!

14:52.460 --> 14:53.180
Am I a dog?

14:54.220 --> 14:55.180
Rude.

14:56.820 --> 14:58.060
Come on, follow me.

15:00.820 --> 15:01.500
What?

15:05.820 --> 15:07.080
Don't you understand?

15:07.140 --> 15:09.180
Senior Du was clearly trying to screw you.

15:09.180 --> 15:10.060
Trying to screw me?

15:10.060 --> 15:11.500
You must have offended him in

15:11.500 --> 15:12.540
in some way.

15:13.300 --> 15:14.820
"Survival Guide"?

15:14.940 --> 15:15.740
That's right.

15:16.060 --> 15:17.620
You don't know how to handle people.

15:17.620 --> 15:19.220
You can get in over your head.

15:20.020 --> 15:20.950
Follow the book.

15:21.100 --> 15:22.160
It's the right way.

15:26.650 --> 15:27.780
I've been studying this

15:27.780 --> 15:30.340
for over 20 years.

15:30.940 --> 15:32.260
With this "Survival Guide",

15:31.240 --> 15:33.130
[Survival Guide]

15:32.660 --> 15:33.660
you can make a good living

15:33.660 --> 15:35.580
in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

15:34.220 --> 15:35.190
[Survival Guide]

15:41.030 --> 15:43.210
[When you see a problem, go around it]

15:41.180 --> 15:42.980
What is this?

15:44.020 --> 15:45.340
Why do I have a similar feeling

15:45.340 --> 15:46.700
of being cheated by you

15:46.980 --> 15:48.300
on the Moon River.

15:50.340 --> 15:52.420
How much is the book?

15:52.420 --> 15:54.020
I can't buy it if it's too expensive.

15:54.020 --> 15:55.500
What are you talking about?

15:55.500 --> 15:56.380
Do we need to talk about money

15:56.380 --> 15:57.300
between us?

15:57.740 --> 15:58.780
Are you kidding?

15:59.540 --> 16:01.300
You're with me, after all.

16:01.820 --> 16:03.260
Anyway, if you don't know what to do,

16:03.260 --> 16:04.260
just read the book.

16:04.260 --> 16:05.700
It explains very clearly.

16:05.700 --> 16:06.900
Let's try to look good

16:07.180 --> 16:08.580
both inside and outside.

16:09.420 --> 16:10.620
Don't be a blockhead.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.140
Okay?

16:11.900 --> 16:13.860
Who's a blockhead? I'm not.

16:14.220 --> 16:14.500
You…

16:14.820 --> 16:15.410
You're not…

16:15.410 --> 16:16.620
Still talking, right?

16:16.620 --> 16:17.580
Give me back my money.

16:17.580 --> 16:18.380
30,000 taels.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.260
Money?

16:19.540 --> 16:20.010
Yes.

16:20.450 --> 16:22.020
Who wants to pay for humiliation?

16:22.020 --> 16:22.820
30,000 taels.

16:23.260 --> 16:23.860
Now.

16:28.540 --> 16:29.380
Actually,

16:29.690 --> 16:31.700
I misspoke.

16:32.500 --> 16:33.660
How can those who make it to the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke

16:33.660 --> 16:34.780
be a blockhead?

16:36.380 --> 16:37.220
So,

16:37.580 --> 16:38.980
take this as

16:39.340 --> 16:40.620
a token of my appreciation.

16:40.620 --> 16:41.450
Okay?

16:43.740 --> 16:44.500
Brother?

16:47.260 --> 16:48.990
You are 18 years old, and I am 23.

16:49.300 --> 16:50.630
What should you call me?

16:52.940 --> 16:54.180
Brother

16:55.700 --> 16:56.900
Lu Li.

16:57.100 --> 16:58.060
Good girl.

17:00.460 --> 17:02.580
If you want to get along in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

17:02.580 --> 17:04.510
you have to listen to your brother.

17:09.540 --> 17:09.980
Got it?

17:14.940 --> 17:17.980
This liar is not so bad.

17:20.819 --> 17:21.859
There are rules in the mansion.

17:21.859 --> 17:22.579
Male disciples

17:22.579 --> 17:23.760
[Lingxi Yard]

17:22.740 --> 17:23.780
live in Zhulu Yard

17:23.760 --> 17:24.720
[Zhulu Yard]

17:24.819 --> 17:25.480
while female disciples

17:25.480 --> 17:26.569
[Zhulu Yard]

17:25.569 --> 17:26.569
live in Lingxi Yard.

17:26.569 --> 17:27.920
[Lingxi Yard]

17:27.540 --> 17:28.580
Although the courtyard is large,

17:28.580 --> 17:29.780
don't stroll around.

17:30.140 --> 17:31.500
Male disciples and female disciples

17:31.500 --> 17:34.300
are not allowed to go into each other's courtyard.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.280
Come in, everyone.

17:36.730 --> 17:38.260
This will be your room from now on.

17:38.260 --> 17:39.520
One bed for each of you.

17:39.700 --> 17:40.580
Make the beds.

17:42.490 --> 17:45.260
[Survival Guide]

17:45.260 --> 17:46.770
[Be a good friend and work as much as you can]

17:45.580 --> 17:47.060
Be a good friend.

17:47.210 --> 17:49.020
Work as much as you can.

17:51.820 --> 17:52.950
Does it really work?

17:55.900 --> 17:56.580
Hi, Sister.

17:56.820 --> 17:57.680
Let me help you.

17:58.540 --> 17:59.740
Thank you.

18:05.620 --> 18:06.540
Okay.

18:06.580 --> 18:07.380
Let me do it.

18:07.700 --> 18:08.420
No need.

18:10.100 --> 18:11.170
Thank you then.

18:19.100 --> 18:20.660
It's my first time making a quilt.

18:20.660 --> 18:21.860
It feels good.

18:28.380 --> 18:29.220
Miss.

18:29.580 --> 18:31.060
Which bed do I have?

18:35.860 --> 18:37.060
They're all full.

18:37.540 --> 18:38.290
Liu Shao.

18:38.980 --> 18:40.300
You're rich, aren't you?

18:40.300 --> 18:41.140
Find your way.

18:53.780 --> 18:55.180
Then where should I stay?

18:58.420 --> 18:59.290
Come with me.

19:06.940 --> 19:07.420
Come on.

19:07.420 --> 19:07.860
Lu.

19:08.860 --> 19:09.300
Lu.

19:09.780 --> 19:11.020
What I respect most in my life

19:11.020 --> 19:12.980
is a wise and brave man like you.

19:14.540 --> 19:16.420
Don't crowd inside the small room with other disciples.

19:16.420 --> 19:17.550
You can stay with me.

19:17.660 --> 19:18.860
Look, take your pick.

19:19.260 --> 19:19.860
Take your pick.

19:19.860 --> 19:20.340
Wait.

19:21.260 --> 19:23.920
The Mansion of Wu Yang Duke has always been fair.

19:24.780 --> 19:26.240
Why are you being special?

19:26.410 --> 19:27.340
You're even given a room

19:27.340 --> 19:29.330
that only the official disciples can stay in?

19:29.330 --> 19:30.060
Actually,

19:30.380 --> 19:30.980
my grandfather

19:30.980 --> 19:33.220
did great things with the former Wu Yang Duke.

19:33.220 --> 19:34.460
He was a meritorious minister.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.380
He begged the Lord

19:35.380 --> 19:36.460
to take care of me.

19:37.900 --> 19:40.760
Good for you. Offspring of a meritorious minister.

19:41.090 --> 19:41.820
Should I

19:42.300 --> 19:43.340
seek shelter from you then?

19:43.340 --> 19:44.820
Not really.

19:45.180 --> 19:46.980
I only get a little help with food and supplies.

19:46.980 --> 19:48.140
As for the following test,

19:48.140 --> 19:50.140
we have to fight it with our ability.

19:50.740 --> 19:51.300
I am

19:51.460 --> 19:52.660
stupid and fat,

19:52.660 --> 19:53.930
and slow to learn martial arts.

19:53.930 --> 19:55.930
No one in my clan thinks highly of me.

19:56.140 --> 19:58.200
Even my father is laughed at for this.

20:01.100 --> 20:02.130
So your father…

20:03.140 --> 20:04.060
Is he

20:05.050 --> 20:05.660
disappointed in you?

20:05.660 --> 20:06.300
No.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.100
My father said I was the best.

20:08.340 --> 20:09.540
My father told me

20:09.780 --> 20:11.310
when I finished my studies,

20:11.500 --> 20:12.780
he'd celebrate it with a banquet

20:12.780 --> 20:14.420
and arrange a marriage for me.

20:14.420 --> 20:15.480
You must come then.

20:15.500 --> 20:16.830
We can have some drinks.

20:18.980 --> 20:19.510
This way.

20:24.700 --> 20:25.620
This is my bed.

20:25.940 --> 20:27.380
You can sleep here from now on.

20:27.380 --> 20:27.740
Oh.

20:28.300 --> 20:29.630
I'll clean it up for you.

20:31.220 --> 20:32.060
There is no other choice.

20:32.060 --> 20:33.900
I'll have to ask you to crowd inside the room with me.

20:33.900 --> 20:34.620
It's okay.

20:34.690 --> 20:35.620
It's fine here.

20:36.260 --> 20:37.180
But Sister,

20:37.300 --> 20:38.660
why do you live here too?

20:40.300 --> 20:42.960
You mean why I live in such a humble place, right?

20:43.260 --> 20:43.860
Actually,

20:44.060 --> 20:46.150
I'm just a lowly servant of the Duke's Mansion.

20:46.150 --> 20:47.930
I do menial work with Bai.

20:48.500 --> 20:49.540
And I've been doing it for a long time.

20:49.540 --> 20:52.000
So I'm allowed to take care of the newcomers.

20:53.100 --> 20:53.980
I'm sorry.

20:54.700 --> 20:55.300
It's okay.

20:55.860 --> 20:57.340
There's food and shelter here.

20:57.340 --> 20:58.940
I'm fully clothed every day.

20:58.940 --> 20:59.860
I'm satisfied.

21:03.460 --> 21:04.060
By the way,

21:05.500 --> 21:07.420
you haven't gotten your disciple's uniform yet, have you?

21:07.420 --> 21:08.420
I have a suit here.

21:08.700 --> 21:09.960
You can wear it for now.

21:10.860 --> 21:13.060
New uniforms will be brought tomorrow.

21:13.260 --> 21:14.320
Thank you, Sister.

21:19.700 --> 21:21.700
What does the "Survival Guide" say?

21:21.900 --> 21:23.960
Money can make the Devil work for you.

21:24.260 --> 21:25.820
There is nothing money can't do.

21:25.820 --> 21:26.940
If someone treats you well,

21:26.940 --> 21:28.820
you have to repay him with money.

21:31.780 --> 21:33.260
Sister, this is for you.

21:39.260 --> 21:42.320
Did someone teach you to take care of things with money?

21:44.180 --> 21:45.860
Then you're using it on the wrong person.

21:45.860 --> 21:47.780
I'm just an insignificant person.

21:47.780 --> 21:48.980
You'd better think about

21:48.980 --> 21:49.740
how to pass the following tests

21:49.740 --> 21:51.000
with your competence.

21:51.020 --> 21:51.460
Oh.

21:55.940 --> 21:57.900
What Brother Lu Li?

21:58.220 --> 21:59.620
He's just a liar.

22:00.060 --> 22:00.740
Damn liar.

22:01.980 --> 22:03.060
I was blind

22:03.180 --> 22:04.580
to think he was immortal.

22:04.810 --> 22:06.340
He doesn't look anything like that.

22:06.340 --> 22:07.100
He's just

22:07.500 --> 22:08.410
a big shithead.

23:46.580 --> 23:49.640
[Chief of the Human Race, Wu Yang Duke]

23:56.700 --> 23:57.300
Who is it?

24:03.260 --> 24:03.970
Sir.

24:04.460 --> 24:06.380
Your sword dance was spectacular.

24:06.380 --> 24:08.060
You just... swish, swish.

24:08.060 --> 24:09.180
Swish, swish.

24:11.700 --> 24:12.660
Awesome.

24:17.460 --> 24:18.620
My father told me

24:18.700 --> 24:20.380
a good show

24:20.660 --> 24:22.580
must be rewarded.

24:25.860 --> 24:27.340
Do you think I'm an entertainer?

24:27.340 --> 24:28.470
That's not the same.

24:28.620 --> 24:30.150
Sir, don't be embarrassed.

24:30.220 --> 24:30.900
Take it.

24:31.060 --> 24:33.190
It's a small token of my appreciation.

24:33.980 --> 24:35.490
The one outside, come out.

24:44.580 --> 24:45.420
Lu Li?

24:48.090 --> 24:50.150
Sir, you don't have to be polite to me.

24:50.620 --> 24:52.060
You're not dressed like

24:52.060 --> 24:54.020
the low-ranking disciples, like me,

24:54.020 --> 24:56.340
nor are you dressed like high-ranking disciples, like Du Mingchong.

24:56.340 --> 24:56.980
I suppose

24:56.980 --> 24:58.900
you're just a lowly disciple.

25:06.100 --> 25:07.700
And you're old.

25:07.980 --> 25:09.340
It must be hard for you.

25:13.730 --> 25:15.020
Am I right, Lu Li?

25:15.580 --> 25:16.620
I don't know you.

25:18.180 --> 25:19.380
I'm Liu Shao.

25:24.340 --> 25:25.340
I'm disciple Lu Li.

25:25.340 --> 25:27.020
This is one of the newcomers, Liu Shao.

25:27.020 --> 25:28.420
Greetings, Wu Yang Duke.

25:32.780 --> 25:33.620
My lord,

25:34.060 --> 25:36.190
please forgive Liu Shao's ignorance.

25:37.540 --> 25:38.090
Kneel.

25:39.140 --> 25:39.540
You...

25:39.740 --> 25:41.100
You are Wu Yang Duke?

25:41.890 --> 25:42.540
No.

25:45.500 --> 25:46.300
She... she...

25:46.580 --> 25:48.260
I'm just an old

25:48.700 --> 25:50.180
and lowly disciple.

25:50.690 --> 25:51.900
It's hard for me.

25:53.210 --> 25:54.460
No, no.

25:54.490 --> 25:55.500
I... I was wrong.

25:58.620 --> 26:00.350
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

26:00.980 --> 26:02.640
In the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

26:02.660 --> 26:03.900
who else would wear neither the high-ranking disciple's uniform

26:03.900 --> 26:05.700
nor the low-ranking disciple's uniform?

26:05.700 --> 26:06.820
I didn't know that.

26:07.090 --> 26:07.730
Besides,

26:08.340 --> 26:09.810
no matter how ignorant you are,

26:09.810 --> 26:11.010
you must have heard of

26:11.220 --> 26:13.220
the Lord's Lightning Slash, right?

26:15.420 --> 26:16.350
Lighting Slash?

26:17.220 --> 26:19.350
That was Lightning Slash you just did?

26:21.940 --> 26:23.420
Do you think

26:23.940 --> 26:25.860
it's worthy of your gold leaf?

26:27.380 --> 26:29.780
It's much more valuable than the gold leaf.

26:31.180 --> 26:32.620
Can you teach me?

26:33.220 --> 26:34.540
Well, you...

26:37.700 --> 26:39.230
Do you really want to learn?

26:39.380 --> 26:40.020
Yes.

27:00.660 --> 27:03.320
This is the simplest move of the Lighting Slash.

27:03.410 --> 27:03.940
Learn it.

27:05.540 --> 27:07.170
My Lord, can you slow down a bit?

27:07.170 --> 27:08.780
It was too fast, and I didn't catch it.

27:08.780 --> 27:10.580
Shut up.

27:11.300 --> 27:12.060
My Lord,

27:12.180 --> 27:13.420
she is stupid and ignorant.

27:13.420 --> 27:15.420
How can she learn your Lightning Slash?

27:15.420 --> 27:16.580
Please forgive her.

27:16.580 --> 27:17.580
She knows she's wrong.

27:17.580 --> 27:18.540
She knows she's wrong.

27:18.540 --> 27:19.870
Do you think I'm joking?

27:20.980 --> 27:22.660
I know who you are.

27:24.020 --> 27:26.020
The demons out there are all after her.

27:26.020 --> 27:26.700
As for you,

27:26.980 --> 27:28.740
the day you came to the mansion, you fought the demons alone.

27:28.740 --> 27:30.870
You were lucky enough to defeat Ao Hen.

27:31.100 --> 27:32.830
You are not simple characters.

27:35.620 --> 27:36.260
My Lord.

27:36.260 --> 27:37.500
You must be mistaken.

27:37.940 --> 27:38.580
I... I...

27:38.580 --> 27:39.910
I have a task for you now.

27:41.020 --> 27:43.150
The official test is half a month away.

27:43.620 --> 27:45.350
If she doesn't learn this move,

27:46.180 --> 27:49.580
the two of you will have to leave the Duke's Mansion together.

27:50.050 --> 27:51.580
You'll also be charged with

27:51.780 --> 27:53.340
the crime of disrespect.

28:12.860 --> 28:14.520
Do I have a grudge against you?

28:16.530 --> 28:17.930
Do I owe you a lot of money?

28:21.370 --> 28:23.340
Why did you come to this forest?

28:23.700 --> 28:24.090
What?

28:26.020 --> 28:27.740
You don't have a grudge against me.

28:27.740 --> 28:29.270
But you owe me a lot of money.

28:29.660 --> 28:30.810
You took my money

28:31.220 --> 28:32.220
and left me alone.

28:33.060 --> 28:34.190
So I ran to the forest

28:34.810 --> 28:35.540
to curse you.

28:36.420 --> 28:37.580
How do you know I don't care about you?

28:37.580 --> 28:38.860
Did you ever take care of me?

28:38.860 --> 28:39.390
I didn't?

28:39.740 --> 28:40.260
I…

28:40.580 --> 28:42.020
What kind of crap is the "Survival Guide"

28:42.020 --> 28:43.060
you gave me?

28:43.980 --> 28:45.300
It was a lie.

28:45.900 --> 28:48.160
I almost didn't even have a place to live.

28:49.900 --> 28:50.380
And

28:50.860 --> 28:52.500
you knew I was new at the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

28:52.500 --> 28:54.100
I didn't know the place well.

28:54.580 --> 28:56.440
But you didn't even come to see me.

28:56.620 --> 28:57.060
I mean.

28:57.780 --> 28:59.580
Aren't you good at martial arts?

29:00.980 --> 29:02.130
I'm just

29:02.740 --> 29:04.260
a useless liar.

29:06.540 --> 29:08.100
How can you

29:09.380 --> 29:11.640
take what a girl says in anger seriously?

29:12.980 --> 29:13.740
Oh, I…

29:16.340 --> 29:17.740
Oh, okay, okay.

29:17.890 --> 29:19.620
I'm wrong, all right?

29:20.540 --> 29:21.700
You are wrong.

29:25.420 --> 29:26.220
I'm wrong.

29:27.300 --> 29:28.300
Give me your hand.

29:30.340 --> 29:30.940
What?

29:31.740 --> 29:32.740
Give it to me.

29:39.500 --> 29:41.760
I'll show you the other world of the liar.

29:43.290 --> 29:44.220
Close your eyes.

30:04.860 --> 30:05.740
Open your eyes.

30:12.460 --> 30:15.230
[Dream Moon Boundary]

30:15.230 --> 30:16.620
What a beautiful place!

30:29.700 --> 30:30.830
Where is this place?

30:32.180 --> 30:34.260
This is the illusion I created with my magic,

30:34.260 --> 30:35.460
Dream Moon Boundary.

30:38.940 --> 30:41.600
But you can't use illusions inside the mansion.

30:42.380 --> 30:43.540
My master taught me how to create

30:43.540 --> 30:44.940
the Dream Moon Boundary.

30:45.780 --> 30:47.580
It's different from other illusions.

30:47.580 --> 30:48.780
It won't be discovered.

30:48.780 --> 30:49.500
Oh.

31:04.020 --> 31:04.740
Pull it out.

31:11.900 --> 31:13.300
I was thinking about

31:13.300 --> 31:14.830
what weapon you should use.

31:15.540 --> 31:18.220
The Lord happened to ask you to practice the Lighting Slash.

31:18.220 --> 31:18.780
How about

31:19.420 --> 31:20.580
trying this sword?

31:21.940 --> 31:23.270
It should suit you well.

31:28.420 --> 31:29.140
It seems

31:29.140 --> 31:30.860
that you've been helping me out.

31:30.860 --> 31:32.790
I'll give you an extra 5,000 taels.

31:34.900 --> 31:37.500
Let's wait until you learn the Lighting Slash.

31:37.900 --> 31:38.780
But

31:39.060 --> 31:40.620
there's half a month left.

31:41.260 --> 31:43.580
I'm suspicious about if I can do it.

31:44.860 --> 31:46.140
You don't know.

31:46.740 --> 31:48.620
In fact, time inside the illusion

31:48.780 --> 31:50.900
passes by much more slowly than outside.

31:50.900 --> 31:51.690
But now,

31:51.690 --> 31:53.090
it's not a matter of time.

31:53.420 --> 31:56.340
We need to know the sword technique of Lighting Slash before carrying on.

31:56.340 --> 31:58.070
We don't have the sword manual.

31:58.140 --> 32:00.090
Now our fate is in your hands.

32:01.220 --> 32:03.180
You have to learn the Lighting Slash.

32:03.180 --> 32:04.090
Or else

32:04.500 --> 32:05.960
we'll be crushed to pieces

32:06.380 --> 32:07.910
like the gold leaf just now.

32:08.860 --> 32:10.660
As for things I'm interested in,

32:10.700 --> 32:12.220
like swordplay,

32:12.220 --> 32:13.820
drawing charms, and skits,

32:14.020 --> 32:15.350
I'm quick to learn them.

32:15.500 --> 32:17.060
But not the things like poetry, rituals, and music,

32:17.060 --> 32:18.780
because I don't like them.

32:19.300 --> 32:21.020
Don't worry, I'll teach you.

32:21.420 --> 32:21.860
Okay.

32:26.260 --> 32:27.100
The first step,

32:27.100 --> 32:28.780
we can't let the little flame

32:29.060 --> 32:30.500
fall from the tip of the sword.

32:30.500 --> 32:31.560
Do you understand?

32:31.580 --> 32:32.140
Yes.

32:38.970 --> 32:39.430
Come on.

32:40.210 --> 32:41.050
Concentrate on

32:41.050 --> 32:43.170
the spirit fire at the tip of the sword.

32:43.170 --> 32:46.980
The sword follows the mind. The mind follows the heart. The mind and the heart coexist.

32:46.980 --> 32:47.860
The power of the sword

32:47.860 --> 32:49.320
will naturally be formed.

34:17.780 --> 34:22.270
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

34:22.460 --> 34:23.739
The new disciples' martial arts test

34:23.739 --> 34:25.739
is in a few days.

34:26.820 --> 34:27.860
Before the test,

34:28.540 --> 34:30.739
according to the Lord's instructions,

34:31.420 --> 34:32.820
I will teach you to practice

34:32.820 --> 34:35.699
the Duke's Mansion's unique method of mental discipline

34:35.699 --> 34:36.580
-to improve your cultivation. -Brother.

34:36.580 --> 34:39.100
You've been hanging out with Liu Shao for the past several days.

34:39.100 --> 34:41.260
Is there something you're not telling me?

34:41.260 --> 34:42.060
Nonsense.

34:42.540 --> 34:45.469
I'm afraid she'll be eliminated. I was tutoring her.

34:47.260 --> 34:49.860
You're not worried about me being eliminated?

34:52.810 --> 34:55.210
I can't believe the new disciple, Liu Shao,

34:55.219 --> 34:57.220
wanted to learn the Lighting Slash.

34:58.180 --> 34:59.840
I gave her half a month's time.

35:00.220 --> 35:00.980
Do you think

35:02.060 --> 35:03.060
she can learn it?

35:06.860 --> 35:07.700
Well.

35:08.060 --> 35:09.540
I think you've overestimated her.

35:09.540 --> 35:10.700
She may not be able to learn it

35:10.700 --> 35:11.860
even in a year.

35:16.300 --> 35:17.500
How much can she learn

35:17.740 --> 35:19.540
in half a month?

35:50.220 --> 35:51.460
I've been practicing for so long.

35:51.460 --> 35:52.980
Do you think I've accomplished it?

35:52.980 --> 35:54.780
The stance is 70 percent like it.

35:55.260 --> 35:56.940
Breath, 30 percent.

35:58.220 --> 35:59.140
Sword intent…

36:04.420 --> 36:05.500
Not a single bit.

36:07.020 --> 36:09.540
What is the sword intent of Lighting Slash?

36:12.900 --> 36:14.300
I have a three-foot blade

36:14.500 --> 36:16.420
to eradicate all the unjust things.

36:16.420 --> 36:19.020
This is the sword intent of the Lighting Slash.

36:20.140 --> 36:21.000
Back in the day,

36:21.860 --> 36:22.720
there was a time

36:22.780 --> 36:24.710
when Wu Yang Duke did great things.

36:26.460 --> 36:27.740
What injustice?

36:29.260 --> 36:29.890
Of course.

36:30.180 --> 36:31.100
This is

36:31.570 --> 36:32.940
too complicated

36:32.940 --> 36:34.340
for Miss Liu

36:34.900 --> 36:36.260
who is high and mighty

36:36.260 --> 36:37.660
and spends money at will,

36:37.780 --> 36:40.060
having no idea of what the world's suffering is.

36:40.060 --> 36:42.390
I don't know about the world's suffering?

36:42.580 --> 36:43.300
I was being chased

36:43.300 --> 36:45.650
by Ao Hen and had no place to stay before I came here.

36:45.650 --> 36:46.980
Demons, big or small,

36:47.140 --> 36:48.370
always come after me.

36:48.940 --> 36:49.660
And now,

36:49.850 --> 36:52.250
I could be killed by Wu Yang Duke at any time.

36:52.460 --> 36:54.700
I'd like to be the old Miss Liu again.

36:55.140 --> 36:55.900
But now

36:56.020 --> 36:57.220
I can't even go home.

37:02.500 --> 37:03.090
Um.

37:04.130 --> 37:04.940
Actually,

37:06.100 --> 37:07.100
it's not that bad.

37:07.260 --> 37:07.990
Don't worry.

37:08.740 --> 37:09.670
I have your back.

37:10.020 --> 37:11.820
I will make your family reunite.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.140
Trust me.

37:14.580 --> 37:15.180
Come on.

37:15.620 --> 37:16.620
Keep practicing.

37:16.860 --> 37:17.320
Come on.

37:20.020 --> 37:23.140
I should think Ao Hen as an injustice.

37:24.580 --> 37:26.410
Kill her, kill her.

37:26.580 --> 37:29.130
Kill her, kill her.

37:46.900 --> 37:49.420
She has gone a little crazy with her practice.

37:49.420 --> 37:51.820
I have to be careful when we practice today.

38:00.220 --> 38:01.540
Your stance is not right.

38:01.540 --> 38:02.670
Who taught you that?

38:04.500 --> 38:05.260
Kill her!

38:06.900 --> 38:08.100
Liu Shao hit Du.

38:08.380 --> 38:08.980
With what?

38:09.220 --> 38:09.940
I don't know.

38:09.940 --> 38:10.800
A golden light.

38:11.620 --> 38:13.480
Liu has been hiding her strength.

38:13.620 --> 38:14.820
Are you okay, Du?

38:16.860 --> 38:18.260
That's all for today's practice.

38:18.260 --> 38:19.420
Everyone, go back to your rooms

38:19.420 --> 38:21.280
and prepare for tomorrow's test.

38:23.380 --> 38:24.340
Amazing.

38:34.140 --> 38:35.940
I can easily exceed the time limit

38:35.940 --> 38:38.140
practicing in the Dream Moon Boundary.

38:38.260 --> 38:40.020
I can't let others find out.

39:07.500 --> 39:09.580
What are you eating? Are you sick?

39:11.180 --> 39:11.840
No, I'm not.

39:13.570 --> 39:14.370
What's wrong?

39:14.580 --> 39:15.140
Sit down.

39:16.900 --> 39:17.630
What's this?

39:19.980 --> 39:20.710
Give it to me.

39:24.620 --> 39:25.940
Spirit-locking pill?

39:27.620 --> 39:28.860
This is Xi's.

39:30.370 --> 39:31.770
Why did she give you this?

39:31.980 --> 39:33.180
Why did you eat it?

39:34.780 --> 39:35.580
Tell me.

39:38.340 --> 39:39.870
Today I went to beg Bai Feng.

39:41.180 --> 39:43.820
She exceptionally let me take the disciple test too.

39:43.820 --> 39:45.660
But I didn't expect such a coincidence.

39:45.660 --> 39:47.460
I was assigned to a group with Xi.

39:48.340 --> 39:49.980
But why would she harm you?

39:51.420 --> 39:53.140
I've worked in the mansion for many years

39:53.140 --> 39:55.020
and learned a lot of skills secretly.

39:55.020 --> 39:56.340
Xi might

39:57.020 --> 39:58.260
be afraid to lose to me

39:58.500 --> 40:00.300
and lose face if I eliminate her.

40:01.620 --> 40:02.180
No way.

40:02.860 --> 40:04.390
I have to go to tell Bai Feng.

40:05.050 --> 40:05.580
Don't go.

40:06.020 --> 40:06.620
Why?

40:09.450 --> 40:11.980
My mother is working as a cook in Xi's mansion.

40:12.700 --> 40:14.900
She signed a life-and-death contract.

40:15.130 --> 40:15.970
So Liu Shao,

40:16.100 --> 40:16.740
it's okay.

40:16.820 --> 40:17.420
Forget it.

40:17.820 --> 40:19.260
Forget it? Why forget it?

40:19.260 --> 40:20.520
We can't just let it go.

40:25.260 --> 40:25.620
Let's see.

40:25.620 --> 40:26.820
This is the sentence.

40:27.420 --> 40:27.900
Xi.

40:28.100 --> 40:30.500
-How dare you poison Xue? -Take a good look.

40:38.220 --> 40:39.500
Liu Shao, are you crazy?

40:39.500 --> 40:40.620
At tomorrow's disciple test,

40:40.620 --> 40:42.060
we will fight against each other.

40:42.060 --> 40:43.620
The losers will quit.

40:44.260 --> 40:46.540
You're afraid of losing to Xue, so you poisoned her.

40:46.540 --> 40:47.620
What are you talking about?

40:47.620 --> 40:48.550
This is slander.

40:50.620 --> 40:51.620
This is evidence.

40:54.460 --> 40:55.580
This is your medicine bottle.

40:55.580 --> 40:58.180
It still smells like the spirit-locking pill.

41:00.020 --> 41:01.660
You're a fool.

41:07.940 --> 41:09.200
Your evidence is gone.

41:10.660 --> 41:11.860
I'll go tell Bai Feng.

41:13.060 --> 41:13.740
Fine by me.

41:14.580 --> 41:16.490
Xue just gets sick.

41:17.700 --> 41:18.630
Go and tell on me.

41:19.380 --> 41:21.180
See if the lowly cook's daughter

41:21.530 --> 41:22.990
dares to fight against me.

41:24.420 --> 41:25.460
Burn the fire, cook the food.

41:25.460 --> 41:26.460
She's self-reliant.

41:26.460 --> 41:28.120
Who are you to say she's lowly?

41:28.420 --> 41:30.480
A lowly person is born to be inferior.

41:32.060 --> 41:33.020
Miss Liu,

41:34.900 --> 41:36.700
don't pretend to be noble.

41:37.290 --> 41:38.580
We're the same.

41:38.970 --> 41:40.620
We were born to be waited on.

41:40.620 --> 41:41.680
We're not the same.

41:42.020 --> 41:43.540
We've never been the same.

41:43.900 --> 41:44.500
Tomorrow,

41:45.540 --> 41:46.670
I will challenge you

41:46.940 --> 41:47.780
for Xue.
